From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: H96 series reconstruction <builder@h96-build>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:26:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 45/59] drm/rockchip: AMD VSDB: FreeSync supported bit and v3
 max refresh

parse_amd_vsdb() took any AMD VSDB with a valid range as FreeSync,
also one that keeps the block with the FreeSync-supported bit clear,
and read the maximum refresh from one byte only.

Layout as the drm/edid AMD VSDB series on dri-devel (2026-07, not
merged): db[4] version 1 to 3, db[5] feature caps with bit 0 FreeSync
supported, db[6] min Hz, db[7] max Hz; a v3 block of 15 or more
payload bytes carries max Hz bits 0-7 in db[14] and bits 8-9 in
db[15] bits 0-1, and bits 10-11 in db[21] bits 0-1 from 21 bytes on.
Versions 1 and 2 have no wider field. Skip the block when the version
is outside 1 to 3 or bit 0 is clear; take the v3 maximum when it is
non-zero. fs_max widens to u16 (gaming_vrr_rate_max is u16 already).

LG UltraGear test monitor block (v2, caps 0x05, 48-144 Hz) parses as
before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P6itje71iKPFBX7YKkfvRo
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.c | 22 +++++++++++++++++++--
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.h |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.c
index 6fb2abcfb..b223e5500 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.c
@@ -1589,11 +1589,29 @@ static void parse_hdmi_forum_scds(struct rockchip_drm_hdmi21_data *hdmi21_data,
 	}
 }
 
-/* AMD VSDB payload after the OUI: version, flags, min Hz, max Hz */
+/*
+ * AMD VSDB after the OUI: db[4] version 1-3, db[5] bit 0 FreeSync supported,
+ * db[6] min Hz, db[7] max Hz. v3 with 15+ payload bytes: max Hz bits 0-7 in
+ * db[14], bits 8-9 in db[15] bits 0-1, bits 10-11 in db[21] bits 0-1 (21+ bytes).
+ */
 static void parse_amd_vsdb(struct rockchip_drm_hdmi21_data *hdmi21_data,
 			   const u8 *db)
 {
-	u8 fs_min = db[6], fs_max = db[7];
+	int len = cea_db_payload_len(db);
+	u8 ver = db[4];
+	u16 fs_min = db[6], fs_max = db[7];
+
+	if (ver < 1 || ver > 3 || !(db[5] & BIT(0)))
+		return;
+
+	if (ver == 3 && len >= 15) {
+		u16 ext = db[14] | (db[15] & 0x3) << 8;
+
+		if (len >= 21)
+			ext |= (db[21] & 0x3) << 10;
+		if (ext)
+			fs_max = ext;
+	}
 
 	if (!fs_min || fs_max <= fs_min)
 		return;
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.h
index 8c4682d59..c15a62610 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_drv.h
@@ -910,7 +910,7 @@ struct rockchip_drm_vrr_cap {
 	/* FreeSync over HDMI range from the AMD VSDB */
 	bool freesync;
 	u8 fs_min;
-	u8 fs_max;
+	u16 fs_max;
 };
 
 struct rockchip_drm_hdmi21_data {
